{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c5484f94765a5190c0a475f4f2c191dabcebbbda78778c4d0ec367b5531d7d1a","ja":"新しい目標","zh":"新的目标","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f2fab56ddf841f6b03e8bc1ab3200829c19f212f653c3a438c08f2214d4520c7","ja":"環ちゃん、本当にありがとう。もしよかったら、\nまた時間があるときに一緒にやりましょ！","zh":"小环，真的很感谢你。如果可以的话，\n等下次有空的时候再一起玩吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"69d47fb793e0471616f86741471a3ffe6fd8e8ab447df2c4917bff10c134fad8","ja":"集まれないときは、お家でやるといいのです。\n姫もお城でラジオ体操するのですよ♪","zh":"聚不起来的时候，在家里做就可以啦。\n公主也会在城堡里做广播体操哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"11c74b1f1e51c44e77204a51b8f38531a60f5238688a9ea301783f64a14d939c","ja":"うん、じゃあたまきもお家で……あ！\nいいこと思いついたぞ！","zh":"嗯，那环在家里也……啊！\n我想到了一个好主意！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e27b4837621e549de8da94252aa949fb797dea5d1e4f0c5df87f2ae48cc01e9f","ja":"みんなでビデオ通話しながらだと、\nいっしょに毎日、ラジオ体操ができるよね！","zh":"大家一起打视频电话的话，\n每天就能一起做广播体操了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5656e164c42599b529e89b99f7b057be41d1889d11a690f812799e41de284cc4","ja":"そっか、ビデオ通話なら……って、えっ！\nま、毎日！？　これからずーっと！？","zh":"这样啊，视频通话的话……等等，诶！？\n每、每天！？　以后一直都这样吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"144f4d2236168b28457ed71317f00c03426120e8d4294a0f5b654620be14e7b5","ja":"環ちゃん、とってもわんだほー！な提案なのです。\nでも、毎日となると、ちょっと大変そうなのです。","zh":"小环的提议非常棒呢！\n不过，要是每天都来的话，好像会有点吃不消呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a0dd2eaf5f71a6c51b8ae69b22c586e94517fa50ff9caf92c64581ed9f1e8f73","ja":"そ、そうだよね！\n毎日早起きしてラジオ体操は、ちょっと……。","zh":"也、也是呢！\n每天早起做广播体操，有点……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"162e6e361e8af62d35f1114d8ae9309d4ca5f70a6a0f9e045b35e410c6774f30","ja":"たまきが起こしてあげるぞ！　たまき、\nふたりにもっともっと元気になってもらいたいんだ！","zh":"环来叫你们起床啦！环想让\n你们两个更加更加打起精神来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6045d28d9774cb6d74a9c47aa32c312cbd65fbcb3aee8515819cc65369430c2b","ja":"環ちゃん……そうだよね。私のために言ってくれてるん\nだから、もうちょっとだけやってみようかな！？","zh":"环……也是呢。你是为了我才这么说的，\n那我再稍微试一试吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"090c33d029cde8109a03107dd72cf56eaf97e93d0c79b01797570246cc0d4f39","ja":"まつりもチャレンジするのです♪\n次の武道館を目標に、それまで続けてみるのですよ！","zh":"茉莉也要挑战哦♪\n以接下来的武道馆为目标，在那之前都要坚持下去哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a5880d85213360283491a7ae24c3680fa65f8105e0d6f36b65b8a8a853b0619b","ja":"あっ、そうだね！　それじゃあ\n武道館に向けて、みんなで頑張ろう！","zh":"啊，说得也是呢！那么\n为了武道馆，大家一起加油吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"86c014d479e8594f135fb6ec8cba641efd9387be3e1b38f04efe5e208439fd89","ja":"わ～い！　じゃあ雪歩お姉ちゃんのお家も\nまつりのお城も見れるね！","zh":"好～耶！　那就能看到雪步姐姐的家，\n还有茉莉的城堡了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5f35882257c34af8e9c3897c0af25cb784f4acd27c70b9c2539509eda005dc49","ja":"くふふ、たまきもお部屋しょうかいするぞ～♪","zh":"嘿嘿，环也要来介绍房间咯～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2ca83b575e6b4e88311eb7bbbdbc424f1bcc7281882af523d57dfc08d1102865","ja":"姫のお城は……ごめんなさい、なのです。","zh":"公主的城堡……非常抱歉呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f53dceafeb04b1f2590fd1c821ea0f004778a6e25282376499bbaaa8f778a92f","ja":"広すぎて電波が届かないかもしれないので、\n姫は別の場所でビデオ通話しますね♪","zh":"这里太宽敞了，可能收不到信号，\n公主去别的地方打视频通话哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"811e568ccd1b2d588bdc10c4de23b9d9530115dc4b3508213f3f83a4d49c57a1","ja":"そうなんだ……！\nざんねんだけど、しかたないね。","zh":"这样啊……！\n虽然很遗憾，但也没办法呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1109.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c0efcb0157020959098490d1520bd5d588a79ee332016d451b8470a5572365a1","ja":"うふふっ♪\nそれじゃあ明日からもまた、よろしくね！","zh":"呵呵呵♪\n那么明天起也请多多关照啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
